OL,3,AThree dead after two helicopters
OL,4,Acollide midair near Oregon airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have died after two
OL,7,Fhelicopters collided midair near a
OL,8,Fsmall airport in Oregon, officials
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe collision involving a Robinson R22
OL,12,Fand an Airbus helicopter occurred near
OL,13,FMcMinnville Municipal Airport on
OL,14,FThursday afternoon. Both aircraft
OL,15,Fcrashed in a field adjacent to a
OL,16,Fhighway, the sheriff's office said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
