OL,3,AThree dead after two helicopters
OL,4,Acollide midair near Oregon airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities identified the victims as a
OL,7,F22-year-old flight instructor from
OL,8,FTexas and a student pilot from the
OL,9,FUnited Kingdom, who were aboard one of
OL,10,Fthe helicopters. The sole occupant of
OL,11,Fthe other aircraft was also killed.
OL,13,FIt was not immediately clear what
OL,14,Fcaused the crash.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
